SUMMARY:TOUK @ Silverstone BRDC Classic
DESCRIPTION:Save the date! 23-25 July 2027 We have been invited back to Sil
 verstone for the BRDC Classic in 2027 following our successful display at 
 the 2025 Silverstone Classic. We will have a special ticket deal for a 1\,
  2 or 3 days tickets for members that wish to attend the event and show of
 f their car on the TOUK club stand. Tickets are expected to open in Decemb
 er and will be managed by Silverstone. Please look out for the TOUK newsle
 tter once bookings open for our special booking link with a 2-4-1 offer. W
 e welcome all Tesla cars if they are of concours level cleanliness\, and a
 lso we will have space for our modified member cars too. If you have a Tes
 la Roadster\, please do contact TOUK before getting your tickets as we wil
 l be able to offer a further discount for you if you can attend 2 or the f
 ull 3 days of the event.\n\nListing: July 23rd–25th\, 2027\n\nWall clock /
  source TZ: Europe/London\n\nEvent & tickets (Ti.to): https://ti.to/teslao
 wnersuk/touk-silverstone-brdc-classic\n\nSource list: upcoming\n\nTi.to DT
 STAMP: 2026-11-25T18:57:52+00:00\n\nTesla Owners UK: https://ti.to/teslaow
